/*
 * The Afrikaans of the interface.
 *
 * The English text the code shows is the key; the value is what the app
 * shows when the language is Afrikaans. A key that is missing here falls
 * back to the English, so the app never breaks over a gap, and
 * tools/check_i18n.py lists the gaps. Entries are JSON-style (double
 * quotes, one per line) so that script can read them; `{name}` is a
 * placeholder the code fills in, and a `|tag` on a key only tells two
 * identical English texts apart.
 *
 * The Church's own words come from the Afrikaans Divine Service Guide
 * ("Handleiding vir Godsdienste"): godsdiens, Boodskap, Inleiding,
 * Samevatting, Agtergrond, Voorlesing, Weekdiens, Diens vir Jongmense,
 * Kinderdiens, Godsdiens vir die ontslapenes, ampsdraers, Kategismus.
 */
