  "Please fill in the highlighted WhatsApp numbers, and correct anything that is wrong. Leave the Member No column alone — it is how the app matches your changes back up. Then send this file back.": "Vul asseblief die gemerkte WhatsApp-nommers in, en maak reg wat verkeerd is. Los die kolom Member No uit — dit is hoe die program jou veranderinge terugpas. Stuur dan hierdie lêer terug.",
