  "{day} {month} is not a date on the calendar.": "{day} {month} is nie 'n datum op die kalender nie.",
  "The weekday names do not match the dates of {month} {year}: check the month of the plan.": "Die weekdae pas nie by die datums van {month} {year} nie: kyk na die maand van die plan.",
  "Services": "Dienste",
