  "Rector": "Voorganger",
  "Tap a service to say who holds it. {n} still has nobody.": "Tik op 'n diens om te sê wie dit hou. {n} het nog niemand nie.",
  "Tap a service to say who holds it. {n} still have nobody.": "Tik op 'n diens om te sê wie dit hou. {n} het nog niemand nie.",
  "Tap a service to change who holds it, its time, or to mark a day without a service.": "Tik op 'n diens om te verander wie dit hou of hoe laat, of om 'n dag sonder diens te merk.",
  "Add a service": "Voeg 'n diens by",
  "A divine service on a day the list does not have, such as a special service the district announces. Christmas Day, Good Friday and Ascension Day are on the list by themselves.": "'n Godsdiens op 'n dag wat nie op die lys is nie, soos 'n spesiale diens wat die distrik aankondig. Kersdag, Goeie Vrydag en Hemelvaartdag is vanself op die lys.",
  "What (optional)": "Wat (opsioneel)",
  "Leave it empty for an ordinary divine service.": "Laat dit leeg vir 'n gewone godsdiens.",
  "Choose the day first.": "Kies eers die dag.",
  "That day is on the list already.": "Daardie dag is reeds op die lys.",
  "Take this day off": "Haal hierdie dag af",
  "{day}: a divine service is held on this day, whatever the weekday. If there is none this year, tick No service below.": "{day}: op hierdie dag word 'n godsdiens gehou, watter weekdag dit ook al is. As daar vanjaar geen is nie, merk Geen diens hieronder.",
